    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Indirect Castle Retreat",
    "steam_appid": 3155660,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a travel photographer and have been invited to a castle for a photo gig. But all of a sudden you are knocked out, and you wake up in the middle of the night. You are clearly not alone. What is going on? How can you find your way out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>- Find a way out of the castle by finding and following clues. Traverse the environment by walking, running, and jumping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Uncover the story of the castle by looking at and interacting with objects. Pick up the objects that you need to progress through the castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Be wary of ghostly activity and walk around with care. React fast to avoid ghostly activity, don't get too hurt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Find bonus items by exploring the castle; They give a glimpse into the castle's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncluttered &amp; Atmospheric - A mystery first, with horror living in the silence between clues</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a tight, hand-crafted mystery where every detail matters. For fans of the tense exploration and environmental storytelling of classic late-90s mystery-horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just you, your wits, and a world where every texture tells a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a combat game, but a game focused on exploring your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;What you don\u2019t see in the darkness is scarier than any 4K monster.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a travel photographer and have been invited to a castle for a photo gig. But all of a sudden you are knocked out, and you wake up in the middle of the night. You are clearly not alone. What is going on? How can you find your way out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>- Find a way out of the castle by finding and following clues. Traverse the environment by walking, running, and jumping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Uncover the story of the castle by looking at and interacting with objects. Pick up the objects that you need to progress through the castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Be wary of ghostly activity and walk around with care. React fast to avoid ghostly activity, don't get too hurt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Find bonus items by exploring the castle; They give a glimpse into the castle's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncluttered &amp; Atmospheric - A mystery first, with horror living in the silence between clues</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a tight, hand-crafted mystery where every detail matters. For fans of the tense exploration and environmental storytelling of classic late-90s mystery-horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just you, your wits, and a world where every texture tells a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a combat game, but a game focused on exploring your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;What you don\u2019t see in the darkness is scarier than any 4K monster.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A third person exploration adventure game. Walk, run, and jump as you explore the castle. Pick up useful items to progress. Understand the history of the castle. This is a tight, hand-crafted mystery where horror lives in the silence between clues.",
